              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "I cannot directly purchase tickets for you because I do not have access to your personal information or payment details. However, I can guide you through booking your return ticket and help you select the best options. \n\nSince today is **Sunday, May 31, 2026**, \"next Friday\" can refer to:\n*   **Friday, June 5, 2026** (this coming Friday)\n*   **Friday, June 12, 2026** (the Friday of the following week)\n\nYou can book your round-trip journey directly online through the [Amtrak Ticket Booking Page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEisMlsMY5GZ-dLSty1IokltX6gbamuoYKLHNf8b72FK0WfUHRHCPLgvvJhWPLYekvaicjDGY6IH-x6N4UD_GvcZJJD3KA6mJopIt69IBu5iiOfMDxXbcbP8YJZNPK0j6GO) or via the [Amtrak Official Website](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFNhqUUL_ou6nB9In-t68u93MO7WbVTpd34z0sCAdaXwFM5P63hN_WgV28UfwtMgFgvPQ7fbNFB3vFHU2UOnn97DZqOzQOn6H9NNcTGCZNThvE=). \n\n### How to book your ticket:\n1.  **Select Trip Type:** Choose **Round Trip**.\n2.  **Departure Station:** Enter **Boston, MA - South Station (BOS)** or **Back Bay Station (BBY)**.\n3.  **Arrival Station:** Enter **New York, NY - Moynihan Train Hall at Penn Station (NYP)**.\n4.  **Dates:** Enter **June 5, 2026** (or **June 12, 2026**) as your departure, and choose your preferred return date.\n5.  **Choose Your Train:** You will have two main options for this route:\n    *   **Northeast Regional:** Takes about **4 hours and 15 minutes**. This is the most affordable option, offering comfortable seating with outlets, free Wi-Fi, and a Cafe Car. \n    *   **Acela (High-Speed):** Takes about **3 hours and 30 minutes**. This is Amtrak's premium service, featuring all-business/first-class seating and a faster commute, though tickets are generally more expensive.\n\n### Travel Tips:\n*   **Book as early as possible:** Friday is a high-demand travel day. Tickets will get more expensive and trains will sell out the closer you get to your departure date.\n*   **Arrive early:** You should plan to arrive at the station at least **30 minutes prior** to your scheduled departure, or **60 minutes prior** if you require assistance with baggage or ticketing.\n*   **Manage your trip on the go:** You can also download [The Amtrak App](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGUqfkXJ0Mzb35fdhMbsBJOhvIh5rLYICmOd8-RcLwjQwodUdFnivKLCMGjTMz7oNSiEd35so74fVCLHtNtKeqSeZQQNGTeQKmz8sxW0LMpqA==) to complete your booking, check live train statuses, and keep your mobile boarding pass handy on your phone.",
