                "end_index": 918,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "You can book your round-trip journey directly online through the [Amtrak Ticket Booking Page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEisMlsMY5GZ-dLSty1IokltX6gbamuoYKLHNf8b72FK0WfUHRHCPLgvvJhWPLYekvaicjDGY6IH-x6N4UD_GvcZJJD3KA6mJopIt69IBu5iiOfMDxXbcbP8YJZNPK0j6GO) or via the [Amtrak Official Website](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFNhqUUL_ou6nB9In-t68u93MO7WbVTpd34z0sCAdaXwFM5P63hN_WgV28UfwtMgFgvPQ7fbNFB3vFHU2UOnn97DZqOzQOn6H9NNcTGCZNThvE=)"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1004,
                "end_index": 1099,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Departure Station:** Enter **Boston, MA - South Station (BOS)** or **Back Bay Station (BBY)**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3,
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1105,
                "end_index": 1192,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Arrival Station:** Enter **New York, NY - Moynihan Train Hall at Penn Station (NYP)**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1317,
                "end_index": 1457,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "**Choose Your Train:** You will have two main options for this route:\n    *   **Northeast Regional:** Takes about **4 hours and 15 minutes**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1459,
                "end_index": 1564,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "This is the most affordable option, offering comfortable seating with outlets, free Wi-Fi, and a Cafe Car"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1571,
                "end_index": 1637,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **Acela (High-Speed):** Takes about **3 hours and 30 minutes**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                5,
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1639,
                "end_index": 1781,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "This is Amtrak's premium service, featuring all-business/first-class seating and a faster commute, though tickets are generally more expensive"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                3
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1872,
                "end_index": 1970,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Tickets will get more expensive and trains will sell out the closer you get to your departure date"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1972,
                "end_index": 2169,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **Arrive early:** You should plan to arrive at the station at least **30 minutes prior** to your scheduled departure, or **60 minutes prior** if you require assistance with baggage or ticketing"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
