                "end_index": 2534,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **Manage your trip on the go:** You can also download [The Amtrak App](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGUqfkXJ0Mzb35fdhMbsBJOhvIh5rLYICmOd8-RcLwjQwodUdFnivKLCMGjTMz7oNSiEd35so74fVCLHtNtKeqSeZQQNGTeQKmz8sxW0LMpqA==) to complete your booking, check live train statuses, and keep your mobile boarding pass handy on your phone"
